{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-tm-knot-pairs-table1-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:tm-knot-pairs-table1-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table 1 from tm-knot-pairs","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tm-knot-pairs"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"tm-knot-pairs-table1-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:tm-knot-pairs-table1-data\"></a><p>Explicit entries of the proton–proton transfer matrix <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">T_{pp}(q)</code> (Section 2a). Its determinant <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-1</code> is the eigenvalue product <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_+ \\lambda_-</code> and its trace <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q - q^{-1}</code> is the eigenvalue sum <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_+ + \\lambda_-</code>, so together they determine the eigenvalues <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\lambda_\\pm</code> of the crossing.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"center\">Entry</th>\n<th>Formula</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1,1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q - q^{-1}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(1,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2,1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(2,2)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\det</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{tr}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q - q^{-1}</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-transfer-matrices/tm-knot-pairs-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
